# Swap Subsystem for xv6-riscv

This repository contains the architectural design and implementation of a highly concurrent Virtual Memory (VM) Management System for xv6-riscv. It features dual-mode `sbrk` allocation, a custom swap subsystem, and advanced concurrency controls to prevent multi-core memory corruption.

